    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d525">

                <pb facs="0729" n="641" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg641"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Señor Bolet Peraza to
                        Mr. Foster.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of Venezuela</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">New
                                York</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1892-09-14"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">September 14, 1892</hi></date>. (Received
                        September 14.)</dateline></opener>
                <p>The witness whose testimony is needed to libel steamer <hi rendition="#italic"
                        >South Portland</hi>, armed and chartered to be used in hostility to my
                    Government, cannot reach New York until late tomorrow. Will you telegraph
                    instructions to detain vessel to enable me to present my proofs?</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">N. Bolet Peraza.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
